To build, simply run
    
    make

followed by
    
    make install

this time as root.

For a local user install from the Ninja build directories, build the release and
debug artifacts and then run the opt-in install target:

    ninja -C build mash16
    ninja -C build-debug mash16 mash16-inspect
    ninja -C build install-user

This installs the release build as ~/bin/mash16, the debug inspector CLI as
~/bin/mash16-inspect, and a ~/bin/mash16-debug symlink to the debug emulator.
Override the destination with:

    cmake -S . -B build -DMASH16_USER_BIN=/path/to/bin
